{"flaws":[{"title":"Downward reset skips an initialized start tick, letting zero-for-one reward distribution use too little active liquidity","severity":"High","lines":"        self.currentTick = startTick;

        if (startTick == self.endTick) return;

        (int16 wordPos,) = TickLib.position(startTick.compress(self.tickSpacing));
